+and one pixel below it, each side against the physical edge of its container in the left-to-right
+and the right-to-left direction, the order between infixes, a dark island and the density factor,
+the priority over a later unlayered rule, and the escape inside the utilities layer. The
+`tests/src/styles/components/clearfix.test.ts` proof reads the height of a host around its float
