+The `tests/src/styles/utilities/object-fit.test.ts` proof photographs a picture wider than its box
+and a picture smaller than its box under every value at every infix, at its boundary and one pixel
+below it, and reads which regions of each box the picture paints. It also reads the order between
+infixes, a dark island and the density factor, the priority over a later unlayered rule, and the
+escape inside the utilities layer.
